author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 300
acceptance_criteria: "pm health --check-only produces a verdict-only projection materially smaller than the full report, or the flag is retired as a documented synonym and the guidance updated in the same change; A passing check emits its verdict and not its evidence; per-check detail is opt-in or reserved for non-passing checks; AGENTS.md and any other agent-facing guidance route to the cheapest form that answers the question, verified by a docs test rather than by review; pm health appears in the token-budget corpus with a declared ceiling measured on a real-scale workspace; The measured token cost of pm health before and after is recorded as evidence on this item"
goal: project management = context management
objective: The diagnostic an agent is told to run when unsure must be the cheapest form that answers the question
value: "Removes a 33k-token cost from the recommended diagnostic path, a surface no existing gate measures"
impact: An agent can check workspace health for the price of a rounding error instead of a sixth of its context window
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: low
confidence: high
